  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whispers follow him through the scrap heaps of Subchain City, tales of a duck who defied the Cryo-storms and emerged... changed. Some say exposure to a forgotten cache of experimental fertilizers turned him into the 'Rotted Hazard' he is today, while others claim he's just incredibly unlucky.",
    "class": "Survivalist",
    "name": "Verdant Doom",
    "personality": "Resilient: Having survived a Cryo-storm and toxic exposure, Verdant Doom is incredibly hard to kill. Pragmatic: He's seen too much to be sentimental, and approaches every situation with cold logic. Grimly Humorous: Finds dark humor in the bleak reality of Subchain City, often cracking jokes that make other ducks uncomfortable.",
